// Buy a course - order, payment, enrolment, receipt (sequence-diagram)
// Contract source: order-service/SYSTEM_DESIGN.md

title Purchase - Order to Enrolment to Receipt

autoNumber on

Student [icon: user]
Frontend [icon: nextjs]
OrderSvc [icon: java, label: "order-service"]
Catalogue [icon: nodejs, label: "course-service"]
Gateway [icon: credit-card, label: "Razorpay / Stripe"]
Kafka [icon: kafka]
Notify [icon: java, label: "notification-service"]

Student > Frontend: click Buy
Frontend > OrderSvc: POST /orders courseId provider idempotencyKey
OrderSvc > Catalogue: GET /internal/courses/:id
Catalogue --> OrderSvc: title price currency amountMinor isPublished
OrderSvc > Catalogue: GET /internal/enrollments/:userId/:courseId
Catalogue --> OrderSvc: already enrolled?
OrderSvc > OrderSvc: insert order CREATED and flush - unique indexes arbitrate
OrderSvc > Gateway: create checkout session
Gateway --> OrderSvc: providerOrderId + public key
OrderSvc > OrderSvc: payment INITIATED, order PENDING
OrderSvc --> Frontend: 201 orderId + checkout bag
Frontend > Gateway: open checkout, student pays
Gateway > Frontend: redirect - tells UI to start polling only
Gateway > OrderSvc: POST /webhooks/{provider} signed raw body
OrderSvc > OrderSvc: verify signature first - nothing written if invalid
OrderSvc > OrderSvc: ONE tx - dedup row, lock order FOR UPDATE, guard transition, order PAID, outbox rows
OrderSvc --> Gateway: 200
OrderSvc > Kafka: order.paid via outbox relay
OrderSvc > Kafka: notifications - NotificationMessage receipt
Kafka > Catalogue: consume order.paid
Catalogue > Catalogue: upsert Enrollment source PURCHASE orderId
Kafka > Notify: consume notifications
Notify > Student: receipt email
opt [label: webhook lost] {
  OrderSvc > Gateway: sweeper - fetch payment by provider order id
  Gateway --> OrderSvc: captured
  OrderSvc > OrderSvc: same guarded transition as the webhook, actor SWEEPER
}
Frontend > OrderSvc: GET /orders/{orderId} poll
OrderSvc --> Frontend: status PAID
Frontend > Catalogue: re-fetch course, now enrolled
